      "text": "both <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced></math> are true",
