  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></math></p><p>Given that:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Solving both equations, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p>Now,</p><p>If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>Since,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, therefore&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>.</p><p>And,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>144</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>96</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>48</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Then,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is true.</p><p>Now,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Sign scheme for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is as follows:</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/80b7c906-dd03-4684-b675-ae46c997f652-image.png\" style=\"width: 330px; height: 91px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8746;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math>, hence it is increasing.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>,&nbsp;hence it is decreasing.</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p>Now,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>12</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>9</mn><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mn>36</mn><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>32</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>36</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>1296</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1152</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>18</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>36</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><mn>18</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is true.</p>",
